  "info_disallow_biometric": "Blocks biometric unlock (fingerprint/face) at the system level (Samsung key). This also affects signing into Azm itself if you rely on fingerprint entry — use with care.",
  "info_disallow_camera_toggle": "Blocks the camera privacy toggle (quick-settings sensor switch). Keeps the camera state from being changed from the sensor panel.",
  "info_disallow_config_default_apps": "Blocks changing the default apps (browser, dialer, SMS, assistant). Keeps your chosen safe defaults in place — for example, a filtered default browser stays the default.",
  "info_disallow_config_private_dns": "Blocks changing the Private DNS setting. Important if your filtering relies on a specific DNS resolver — changing it would silently disable the filter. Side effect: the DNS provider is frozen while it is on.",
  "info_disallow_microphone_toggle": "Blocks the microphone privacy toggle (Samsung/quick-settings sensor switch). Keeps the microphone state from being changed from the sensor panel.",
  "info_ensure_verify_apps": "Requires app verification (Play Protect-style scanning of installs) to stay on. Keeps a safety net against harmful apps; turning protections off is a common first step in bypass guides.",
  "info_no_add_clone_profile": "Blocks creating a clone profile or cloned apps (Samsung). Cloned apps are a second, separate copy that limits may not cover.",
  "info_no_add_managed_profile": "Blocks creating a work/managed profile. A separate profile can hold its own unfiltered apps.",
  "info_no_add_private_profile": "Blocks creating a private profile/space. A private space can hide apps from the main view and from casual checks.",
  "info_no_add_user": "Blocks creating new Android users on the device. A second user is a completely unfiltered space, so this closes a major bypass.",
  "info_no_add_wifi_config": "Blocks adding new Wi-Fi network configurations while leaving existing ones usable. A softer version of locking Wi-Fi completely.",
  "info_no_adjust_volume": "Blocks changing the volume. Sometimes used to keep warning sounds audible. Side effect: volume keys stop working for media and calls.",
  "info_no_airplane_mode": "Blocks turning on airplane mode. Prevents cutting connectivity to escape network filtering — though Wi-Fi can usually be rejoined. Side effect: no airplane mode for flights while it is on.",
  "info_no_ambient_display": "Blocks the ambient display (always-on glance screen). Minor display behaviour control.",
  "info_no_assist_content": "Blocks sharing screen content with the assistant. Privacy-oriented; the assistant loses screen context.",
  "info_no_autofill": "Blocks the autofill framework (password/form autofill). Security-oriented; side effect: no saved-password autofill anywhere.",
  "info_no_bluetooth": "Blocks using Bluetooth at all. Side effect: headphones, watches, and car connections stop working.",
  "info_no_bluetooth_sharing": "Blocks sharing files over Bluetooth while leaving Bluetooth audio working. A narrower, gentler option than blocking Bluetooth entirely.",
  "info_no_camera": "Blocks the camera entirely (Samsung key). Side effect: no app can take photos or video, including Azm-free uses like scanning documents.",
  "info_no_change_wifi_state": "Blocks turning Wi-Fi on or off. Useful when the connection state itself is part of the routine. Side effect: no quick Wi-Fi toggling from quick settings.",
  "info_no_config_bluetooth": "Blocks changing Bluetooth settings (pairing new devices). Side effect: new accessories cannot be paired while it is on.",
  "info_no_config_brightness": "Blocks changing screen brightness settings. Minor; mainly keeps display settings stable.",
  "info_no_config_cell_broadcasts": "Blocks changing cell broadcast (emergency alert) settings. Leave this off unless you have a specific reason — emergency alerts matter.",
  "info_no_config_credentials": "Blocks changing stored credentials and installing certificates. Important because a user-installed certificate can enable traffic interception and filter bypass. Side effect: work/school certificate setups are frozen.",
  "info_no_config_date_time": "Blocks changing the date and time. Protects time-based limits and schedules from being cheated by moving the clock. Side effect: manual time correction is off; automatic time still works.",
  "info_no_config_locale": "Blocks changing the system language/region settings. Keeps the device configuration stable.",
  "info_no_config_location": "Blocks changing location settings. Keeps location-based behaviour stable; it does not itself block content.",
  "info_no_config_mobile_networks": "Blocks changing mobile network settings (APN, network mode, operator). Useful because APN tricks can route around DNS filtering. Side effect: roaming and carrier settings are frozen too.",
  "info_no_config_screen_timeout": "Blocks changing the screen timeout. Keeps the display-off behaviour you chose; a minor routine protection.",
  "info_no_config_tethering": "Blocks changing any tethering settings (Wi-Fi, USB, Bluetooth hotspot). Keeps the phone from becoming a side door around network filtering.",
  "info_no_config_vpn": "Blocks changing VPN settings. Important: a VPN can bypass DNS-based filtering entirely, so locking VPN settings protects the whole setup. Side effect: you cannot add or switch VPNs while it is on.",
  "info_no_config_wifi": "Blocks changing Wi-Fi settings: joining new networks or forgetting saved ones. Useful against hopping to an unfiltered network. Side effect: you cannot join a new Wi-Fi network while it is on.",
  "info_no_config_wifi_private": "Blocks changing the private (randomized) MAC address setting for Wi-Fi (Samsung). Keeps network identity stable so network-level filters keep recognizing the device.",
  "info_no_config_wifi_shared": "Blocks changing shared Wi-Fi configuration options (Samsung). Keeps network settings from being quietly altered.",
  "info_no_content_capture": "Blocks apps from capturing screen content for features like screenshot-based assistants. A privacy control; may break some smart-selection features.",
  "info_no_content_suggestions": "Blocks content suggestions (smart replies/suggestions drawn from screen content). Privacy-oriented; minor.",
  "info_no_control_apps": "Blocks opening app-info screens where apps can be force-stopped, cleared, or have their permissions changed. Stops a common bypass route. Side effect: you also cannot manage app storage or permissions there while it is on.",
  "info_no_create_windows": "Blocks apps from drawing overlay windows on top of other apps. Increases security against tap-jacking, but breaks legitimate overlays like chat bubbles and some accessibility tools.",
  "info_no_cross_profile_copy_paste": "Blocks copy/paste between profiles. Stops text and links moving from the controlled profile into another one.",
  "info_no_data_roaming": "Blocks data roaming. Mostly a cost control; it does not filter content.",
  "info_no_debugging_features": "Blocks debugging features such as ADB. Prevents changing the device from a computer to bypass protection. Side effect: developers cannot debug this device while it is on.",
  "info_no_factory_reset": "Blocks factory reset from settings. Protects the whole setup from being wiped in a weak moment. This is a strong setting: recovery through Azm's own removal flow remains possible, but the settings route is closed.",
  "info_no_fun": "Blocks Android's fun/easter-egg features. Harmless and mostly cosmetic.",
  "info_no_grant_admin": "Blocks granting device-admin rights to other apps. Prevents another admin app from interfering with Azm's position.",
  "info_no_install_apps": "Blocks installing new apps entirely. Useful when you want the phone's current app set frozen. Side effect: even trusted apps cannot be added until this is off.",
  "info_no_install_unknown_sources": "Blocks installing apps from outside the Play Store (APK files, browsers, file managers). One of the strongest protections against sideloaded distractions and malware. Side effect: legitimate APK installs are also blocked.",
  "info_no_install_unknown_sources_globally": "The global version of the unknown-sources block: it applies everywhere on the device, for every user and profile. Stronger than the per-source setting, and it also blocks legitimate APK installs device-wide.",
  "info_no_modify_accounts": "Blocks adding or removing accounts on the device. A new account can be a fresh start that escapes app-level habits. Side effect: you cannot sign into new services at the system level while it is on.",
  "info_no_network_reset": "Blocks resetting network settings. A network reset can wipe saved Wi-Fi and DNS-related state in one tap.",
  "info_no_non_market_app_by_knox": "Blocks apps from outside the official stores at the Samsung Knox level. Knox's own sideloading block; may overlap with the unknown-sources restrictions.",
  "info_no_outgoing_beam": "Blocks Android Beam (NFC tap-to-share). A small side channel for passing links and files between phones.",
  "info_no_outgoing_calls": "Blocks making outgoing calls. A heavy restriction for communication control; emergency calls are never blocked by Android.",
  "info_no_physical_media": "Blocks mounting external storage (SD cards, USB drives). Closes a route for bringing in unfiltered content. Side effect: memory cards cannot be used while it is on.",
  "info_no_printing": "Blocks printing from the device. Minor; closes a route for exporting content to paper or PDF printers.",
  "info_no_remove_managed_profile": "Blocks removing the managed (work) profile. Keeps an existing managed space intact.",
  "info_no_remove_user": "Blocks removing existing Android users. Keeps the device's user structure unchanged.",
  "info_no_safe_boot": "Blocks booting into Safe Mode. Important: Safe Mode disables accessibility services and third-party enforcement, so it is a classic bypass. Side effect: Safe Mode troubleshooting is unavailable while it is on.",
  "info_no_set_user_icon": "Blocks changing the user profile picture. Cosmetic only.",
  "info_no_set_wallpaper": "Blocks changing the wallpaper. Cosmetic stability; occasionally used to keep a motivational wallpaper in place.",
  "info_no_share_location": "Blocks sharing the device's location with apps. A privacy protection rather than a content filter.",
  "info_no_sharing_into_profile": "Blocks sharing content from the main profile into another profile. Keeps content from being passed into a less-controlled space.",
  "info_no_sim_globally": "Blocks using the SIM entirely (calls and mobile data). A very heavy restriction — the phone loses mobile service while it is on.",
  "info_no_sms": "Blocks sending SMS messages. Communication control; messaging apps are unaffected.",
  "info_no_system_error_dialogs": "Blocks system error dialogs (app-crash popups). Cosmetic/enterprise behaviour; crashes still happen, just silently.",
  "info_no_thread_network": "Blocks creating/joining Thread border-router networks (smart-home). Niche; irrelevant for most phones.",
  "info_no_ultra_wideband_radio": "Blocks the ultra-wideband (UWB) radio used by precision trackers. Niche hardware control.",
  "info_no_unified_password": "Blocks requiring one unified password across work and personal profiles. Enterprise-oriented; irrelevant on a single-profile phone.",
  "info_no_uninstall_apps": "Blocks uninstalling apps. Useful to stop a blocked app from simply being deleted to escape its limits — and to protect Azm's companion setup. Side effect: you cannot remove any app while this is on.",
  "info_no_unmute_microphone": "Blocks unmuting the microphone during calls. A managed-device privacy control; rarely relevant for personal use.",
  "info_no_usb_file_transfer": "Blocks transferring files over USB. Prevents moving content on or off the phone by cable. Side effect: USB photo/file import stops too; charging still works.",
  "info_no_user_switch": "Blocks switching between Android users. Companions the no-new-users rule: even existing extra users cannot be entered.",
  "info_no_wallpaper": "Blocks wallpaper changes (Samsung key). Cosmetic stability, like the standard wallpaper restriction.",
  "info_no_wifi_direct": "Blocks Wi-Fi Direct connections (device-to-device sharing without a router). Closes a side channel for sharing files and content. Side effect: some printers and sharing features stop working.",
  "info_no_wifi_tethering": "Blocks Wi-Fi hotspot tethering settings. Prevents sharing the phone's connection to bypass filters on other devices.",
  "restrictionInfoGeneric": "This setting restricts part of the system. Turning it on tightens the device; turning it off loosens it. If you are not sure, leave it off and ask later.",
